The [[Wolpertinger]] is a godly [[Pet]] available in the shop for all classes. It passively increases the player's stamina regeneration for each buff they have. Every once in a while it will grant 3 of the buffs the player has the least of. It also triggers faster for each adjacent [[Pet]], up to an unlikely maximum of 120% faster.

With a lot of buff gain, having a [[Wolpertinger]] can help a lot with wielding multiple weapons.
